{"unit_id":"tag:08JI:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003> 为复形（complexes），由 <MATH_0004>-模（modules）组成，满足\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005>，当 <MATH_0006> 时，\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0007>，当 <MATH_0008> 时，且\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0009> 同构（isomorphic）于某个有限自由（finite free）<MATH_0010>-模（module）的直和因子（direct summand）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n则内部 Hom（internal hom）<MATH_0011> 由复形（complex）<MATH_0012> 表示（represented），其各项（terms）为\n<MATH_0013>，\n微分（differential）如第 <REF_0001> 节所述。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"direct summand","target_term":"直和因子"},{"source_term":"internal hom","target_term":"内部 Hom"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"represented","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"各项"},{"source_term":"differential","target_term":"微分"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"系数位点"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"内部 Hom 输入"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"逐项投射条件"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由","context":"逐项有限投射性"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"投射单项"},{"source_term":"direct summand","target_term":"直和因子","context":"投射性描述"},{"source_term":"internal hom","target_term":"内部 Hom","context":"导出内部 Hom"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"显式代表"},{"source_term":"represented","target_term":"表示","context":"代表关系"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"各项","context":"代表的组成"},{"source_term":"differential","target_term":"微分","context":"内部 Hom 的微分"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08JI:proof","translation":"选择拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）<MATH_0001>，其中 <MATH_0002> 为由内射对象（injectives）组成的下有界（bounded below）复形（complex）。注意 <MATH_0003> 为 K-内射（injective）（《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0001>）。因此，第 <REF_0002> 节的构造表明 <MATH_0004> 由复形（complex）<MATH_0005> 表示，其各项（terms）为\n<MATH_0006>\n（等号成立，因为非零项（nonzero terms）只有有限多个）。注意 <MATH_0007> 为总复形（total complex），对应于各项（terms）为\n<MATH_0008>\n的双复形（double complex），对 <MATH_0009> 也类似。自然映射（map）<MATH_0010> 来自双（double）复形（complexes）的映射（map）。因此，为证明此映射（map）为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism），可使用双复形（double complex）的谱序列（spectral sequence）（《同调代数（Homology）》引理 <REF_0003>）\n<MATH_0011>，\n它收敛（converging）于 <MATH_0012>，对 <MATH_0013> 也类似。为完成引理的证明，只需证明当 <MATH_0016> 是某个有限自由（finite free）<MATH_0017>-模（module）的直和因子（direct summand）时，<MATH_0014> 在上同调层（cohomology sheaves）上诱导同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0015>。\n由于当 <MATH_0018> 有限自由（finite free）时这一点显然成立，结论随之得出。\n","allowed_english":["K-"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"injectives","target_term":"内射对象"},{"source_term":"bounded below","target_term":"下有界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"各项"},{"source_term":"nonzero terms","target_term":"非零项"},{"source_term":"total complex","target_term":"总复形"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"各项"},{"source_term":"double complex","target_term":"双复形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"double","target_term":"双"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"double complex","target_term":"双复形"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调代数"},{"source_term":"converging","target_term":"收敛"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"direct summand","target_term":"直和因子"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"替换与比较"},{"source_term":"injectives","target_term":"内射对象","context":"替换的各项"},{"source_term":"bounded below","target_term":"下有界","context":"替换的范围"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"代表对象"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"K-内射条件"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"引用章节"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"各项","context":"显式代表"},{"source_term":"nonzero terms","target_term":"非零项","context":"有限和与积的一致"},{"source_term":"total complex","target_term":"总复形","context":"内部 Hom 的代表"},{"source_term":"double complex","target_term":"双复形","context":"谱序列的输入"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"代表间比较"},{"source_term":"double","target_term":"双","context":"双复形的修饰"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"比较的双复形"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列","context":"比较上同调"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调代数","context":"引用章节"},{"source_term":"converging","target_term":"收敛","context":"谱序列的极限"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由","context":"单项比较"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"投射单项"},{"source_term":"direct summand","target_term":"直和因子","context":"由自由情形推得"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层","context":"逐项比较"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"比较结论"}],"notes":["K-前缀与内射（injective）共同表达 K-injective；双（double）与复形（complexes）共同表达 double complexes。"]}
